irradiancy.definition:
n. The act of irradiating; emission of rays of light.
n. That which irradiates or is irradiated; luster;
   splendor; irradiation; brilliancy.

irresoluble.definition:
a. Incapable of being dissolved or resolved into parts;
   insoluble.
a. Incapable of being relieved or assisted.

irritancy.definition:
n. The state or quality of being null and void; invalidity;
   forfeiture.
n. The state o quality of being irritant or irritating.
